# data/ is pipeline working data (transcripts, fragments, embeddings, media).
# It used to be tracked -- 1,211 files / 137 MB -- which made clones slow and
# put derived artifacts under review alongside code. S3 is the source of
# truth; use scripts/sync_data_to_s3.py and scripts/download_data_from_s3.py
# to move it. Untracking does not shrink existing history, only future clones.
#
# Only .gitkeep files are kept so the directory layout survives a fresh clone.
data/
!data/.gitkeep
!data/**/.gitkeep

